# e2e/st-enemy-clickable.spec.ts — the operator, 2026-10-13: "enemy planeswalker is showing as
# clickable not sure". Alice (seat 0) attacks with Memnite and holds Giant Growth with a Forest
# up, so she keeps her own priority stop in declare attackers once the attack is confirmed. Bob
# holds one permanent of each non-creature type: a planeswalker (with its loyalty — see
# `w46-b-planeswalker.state`'s header), an artifact, an enchantment and a land. Forge names none
# of them at alice's priority stop, so none of them may be drawn clickable on her screen.
